WEBVTT

00:06:28.163 --> 00:06:33.913
I mean, it's the word happiness which
seems to stand for the whole dimension.

00:06:34.204 --> 00:06:35.204
And

00:06:36.246 --> 00:06:41.079
and and I think this is leading
to some policies, actually,

00:06:41.079 --> 00:06:47.413
this failing to lead to policies that
would that would really be directed at

00:06:47.579 --> 00:06:50.996
increasing human well-being
by decreasing misery.

00:06:51.829 --> 00:06:54.954
Yeah, I think so, too. And it's something
I've thought about a lot at work.

00:06:54.954 --> 00:06:58.496
Given given the hat I wear most often
is organisational psychologist,

00:06:59.079 --> 00:07:03.288
I feel like the obsession with employee
engagement has really missed the mark.